            0.262,
            0.166,
            0.475,
            0.215
          ],
          "content": "How did they measure the distance between the Earth and the Sun?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.479,
            0.316,
            0.599,
            0.334
          ],
          "content": "**6400 × 62,500**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.281,
            0.346,
            0.795,
            0.427
          ],
          "content": "**is the average number of litres of water the Amazon river discharges into the Atlantic Ocean every second. The river's flow into the Atlantic is so much that drinkable freshwater is found even 160 kilometers into the open sea.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.524,
            0.849,
            0.582
          ],
          "content": "As you did before, divide the given numbers to uncover interesting facts about division. Share your thoughts and questions with the class after you uncover each number."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.414,
            0.723,
            0.534,
            0.74
          ],
          "content": "13,95,000 ÷ 150"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.197,
            0.752,
            0.253,
            0.772
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Mosco"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.26,
            0.751,
            0.688,
            0.838
          ],
          "content": "is the distance (in kms) of the longest single-train journey in the world. The train runs in Russia between Moscow and Vladivostok. The duration of this journey is about 7 days. The longest train route in India is from Dibrugarh in Assam to Kanyakumari in Tamil Nadu; it covers 4219 kms in about 76 hours."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.726,
            0.853,
            0.819,
            0.869
          ],
          "content": "Vladivostok"
        },
